  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN222.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">tōḻikkut talaimakaṉ ciṟaippuṟamākat talaimakaḷ colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What SHE said to the confidante while HE was behind the hedge.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN222.1">
        <l>vāṉuṟa nivanta nīrniṟap perumalaik</l>
        <l>kāṉa nāṭa ṉu[ṟī]iya nōykkeṉ</l>
        <l>mēṉi yāynalan tolaitaliṉ moḻivēṉ</l>
        <l>muḻavumukam pularāk kaliko ḷāṅkaṭ</l>
        <l>kiḻā[a]rp peruntuṟai viḻavi ṉōṭu</l>
        <l>mīṭṭeḻiṟ polinta vēntukuvavu moympi</l>
        <l>ṉāṭṭa ṉatti nalaṉayan turaiit</l>
        <l>tāḻiruṅ katuppiṟ kāviri vavvaliṉ</l>
        <l>mātiran tuḻaii matimaruṇ ṭalanta</l>
        <l>vāti manti kātaliṟ kāṭṭip</l>
        <l>paṭukaṭal pukka pāṭucāl ciṟappiṉ</l>
        <l>manti yaṉṉa māṇpukaḻ peṟīiyar</l>
        <l>ceṉmō vāḻi tōḻi paṉṉā</l>
        <l>ḷuravuru mēṟoṭu mayaṅki</l>
        <l>yiravuppeyal poḻinta vīrnta ṇāṟē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="3a-c">Since the delicate goodness of my body is lost,</l>
        <l corresp="2">because of the pain caused by the man from a forest land</l>
        <l corresp="1">with large mountains the colour of [dark] water that came up to reach the sky,</l>
        <l rend="indent8" corresp="3d">	I will speak:</l>
        <l corresp="12">in order to obtain glorious fame like the she-monkey</l>
        <l corresp="11">of a superiority worthy to be sung, who entered the rising sea,</l>
        <l corresp="10">showing love for Ātimanti,</l>
        <l corresp="9">who suffered, confused in [her] mind, turning in [all] directions,</l>
        <l corresp="8">as the Kāviri snatched at [her] hanging dark hair,</l>
        <l corresp="7">talking longingly of the goodness of Āṭṭaṉatti</l>
        <l corresp="6">with eminent plump shoulders that flourished with gathered graces</l>
        <l corresp="5">who ran in the festival by the big ghat with a water lift,</l>
        <l corresp="4">in that bustling place where the face of the drum does not dry,</l>
        <l corresp="13">go, oh friend, many days,</l>
        <l corresp="15">on the wet [and] cool path overflowed with rain by night,</l>
        <l corresp="14">confused with heavy thunderclaps.</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
